criteria.text:
A prune started beside a running gate waits or refuses naming the gate;
   a gate's `host` task started beside an applying prune waits or refuses
   naming the prune; neither leaves the other's subject changed; cases.

Every generated role root states the bound, the standing command and
   the routes; the role oracle fixture pins the roots with its chain intact;
   the decisions record each root's cold-start bytes before and after.

Product 07 and the kit README state the mechanism as built (step 10);
    `npm run publication:check`, `npm test -- --review` and `npm run
    test:docs` green; `git diff --check` clean; no new dependency.

The consumer selection (WO-213-D014) is kept: in a kit root `npm test`
    and `npm test -- --review` run the six structural tasks and `kit-verify`
    fresh and append the declared instance suites criterion 18 selects, run
    fresh; no carried kit suite enters either selection and no row is reused;
    outside a kit root, selection and reuse equal today's (runner fixtures;
    one export case).
